1. Start.
2. Read N. If N is outside 5–15, ask again.
3. Read N ticket IDs. If any ID is outside 1–N, ask again.
4. Display the original ticket sequence.
5. Count each ID's occurrences to find the duplicate and missing IDs.
6. If the log is invalid, display Invalid scan log and stop.
7. Use nested loops to count out-of-order pairs.
8. Read R (last two digits of registration number).
9. Calculate Target = (R % N) + 1.
10. Display the target ID, all its positions, and occurrence count.
11. Stop.
